# Pairs with TypeOK. A claim is recorded twice, so the claim count runs past
# the number of captures.
MODULE: TypeOkClaimRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim is counted twice
PERTURBS: Resolve

--- FIND
          ELSE /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![s] = @ + 1]
--- REPLACE
          \* MUTATION: two claims per capture.
          ELSE /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![s] = @ + 2]
--- END
